# BookRentNew - Project Specification

## Project Overview

**Project Name:** BookRentNew  
**Version:** 1.0.0  
**Type:** Mobile Application (iOS, Android, Web)  
**Domain:** Book Rental Platform  
**Bundle ID:** com.fareez123.BookRentNew

### Purpose
A peer-to-peer book rental platform connecting book owners with readers. Owners can list their books for rent, and readers can browse and rent books with flexible delivery options.

