## Application Features

### User Roles

#### Reader Role
- Browse available books
- Search and filter books by category
- View detailed book information
- Rent books with flexible duration (1-12 months)
- Select delivery method (Postage, COD, Store Pickup)
- View rental history and active rentals
- Manage wallet and payments
- Rate and review books

#### Owner Role
- List books for rent
- Set rental price and availability
- Manage book inventory and stock
- Track rental statistics
- View revenue and earnings
- Update book details and prices
- Handle book returns and conditions

### Core Features

#### Book Management
- Add/Edit/Delete books (Owner)
- Stock level tracking
- Multiple book formats (Paperback, Hardcover, eBook)
- Category-based organization
- Image upload for book covers

#### Rental System
- Flexible rental duration (1-12 months)
- Multiple delivery options:
  - **Postage/Courier:** RM7 fee
  - **Cash on Delivery (COD):** RM0 fee
  - **Store Pickup:** RM0 fee
- Security deposit system (equals rental cost)
- Rental price calculation per month
- Minimum order requirement (RM10)
- Cart system with locked delivery method

#### Payment System
- Wallet integration
- Payment confirmation modal
- Security deposit handling
- Refund management
- Transaction history

