## Business Logic

### Pricing Model
```javascript
Total Cost = (Rental Price × Duration) + Delivery Fee + Security Deposit

Where:
- Rental Price: Per month cost set by owner
- Duration: Number of months (1-12)
- Delivery Fee: RM7 (Postage) | RM0 (COD/Pickup)
- Security Deposit: Rental Price × Duration (fully refundable)
```

### Stock Management
- Stock decreases by 1 when book is rented
- Stock increases by 1 when book is returned
- Visual indicators:
  - **High Stock (>5):** Green - "In stock and ready to rent"
  - **Low Stock (1-5):** Orange - "Limited availability - rent now!"
  - **Out of Stock (0):** Red - "Out of stock - Check back later"

### Rental Rules
- Minimum order: RM10
- All books in cart must use same delivery method
- Delivery method locked after first item added
- Security deposit equals total rental cost
- Full refund on good condition return
- Partial refund on minor damage
- No refund on loss or severe damage

