## Data Models

### Book Model
```javascript
{
  id: string,                    // Unique identifier
  title: string,                 // Book title
  author: string,                // Author name
  cover: string,                 // Image URL
  price: number,                 // Rental price per month (RM)
  description: string,           // Book description
  stock: number,                 // Available quantity
  category: string,              // Genre/category
  format: 'Paperback' | 'Hardcover' | 'eBook',
  owner: {
    id: string,
    name: string,
    avatar: string,
    rating: number
  },
  rating: number,                // Average rating (1-5)
  totalReviews: number,
  isAvailable: boolean,
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### Rental Model
```javascript
{
  id: string,
  bookId: string,
  book: Book,
  userId: string,
  ownerId: string,
  duration: number,              // Months (1-12)
  rentalPrice: number,           // Price per month
  deliveryMethod: 'postage' | 'cod' | 'pickup',
  deliveryFee: number,
  deposit: number,               // Security deposit
  totalCost: number,
  status: 'pending' | 'active' | 'returned' | 'overdue' | 'cancelled',
  startDate: Date,
  endDate: Date,
  returnDate?: Date,
  condition: 'good' | 'minor_damage' | 'major_damage' | 'lost',
  refundAmount: number,
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### User Model
