## API Integration (Future)

### Backend Requirements
Currently the app runs with mock data. Future backend integration needs:

#### Endpoints Required
```javascript
// Authentication
POST   /api/auth/register
POST   /api/auth/login
POST   /api/auth/logout
GET    /api/auth/me

// Books
GET    /api/books
GET    /api/books/:id
POST   /api/books              // Owner only
PUT    /api/books/:id          // Owner only
DELETE /api/books/:id          // Owner only
GET    /api/books/search?q=

// Rentals
POST   /api/rentals            // Create rental
GET    /api/rentals            // User's rentals
GET    /api/rentals/:id
PUT    /api/rentals/:id/return
PUT    /api/rentals/:id/cancel

// Payments
POST   /api/payments/charge
POST   /api/payments/refund
GET    /api/wallet/balance
GET    /api/wallet/transactions

// Users
GET    /api/users/:id
PUT    /api/users/:id
GET    /api/users/:id/ratings
```

#### Authentication
- JWT-based authentication
- Secure token storage (AsyncStorage)
- Automatic token refresh
- Role-based access control

